description_text:
Version 1.2 update for more friendly to different printer models
Photos of the print out (by Phrozen Sonic 4K DLP) and assembled stepper part have been include for proving design is fine details and printable 
Sci-Fi Robot / Mech Hangar / Chain Base / Garage (格納庫 / 発射台) 

  -     launcher deck with 2 scale foot stepper 1:100 and 1:144. MG and HG GUNPLA models compatible.

  -     Featured runway light guide and Jet flame deflector;

  -     Customizable angle Jet flame deflector;

  -     Customizable length of launch runway (From 100mm long minimum with extension unit of 50mm) ;

  -     Customizable angle of foot stepper;

  -     Customizable position of foot stepper;

  -     Customizable runway deck plate

  -     with 3 mm extension holes compatible to GUNPLAs;

  -     Can combine with My other Mecha Hangar Bay e.g. -MHB01C-, -MHB02C-, -MHB03C- and -MHBV01C-, etc
